---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SketchUnderline from '../components/SketchUnderline.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Discord Asset Studio" description="Terms of service and usage guidelines for Discord Asset Studio: an open, client-side creator utility.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#3368A0] dark:text-[#66A3BF] uppercase tracking-wider">Legal Notice</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#192538] tracking-tight mt-2 mb-4">
        Terms of <span class="relative inline-block sketch-trigger"><span class="relative z-10">Service</span><SketchUnderline color="#66A3BF" /></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[#475569] text-base leading-relaxed">
        Effective date: September 16, 2026. Please review these terms before utilizing our client-side asset validation tooling.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-[#475569] text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-[#E0DBD0] pt-8">
      <section class="card-panel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[14px]">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#192538] mb-3">1. Permitted Use & Operation</h2>
        <p>
          Discord Asset Studio provides client-side utilities designed to assist creators, server managers, and digital designers in inspecting, resizing, and preparing media assets in conformance with published platform specifications. All processing occurs locally within your web browser. You retain full copyright and ownership of all media you load into our utilities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card-panel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[14px]">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#192538] mb-3">2. Non-Affiliation Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Discord Asset Studio is an independent open project and is not sponsored, endorsed, or affiliated with Discord, Inc. "Discord", the Discord logo, Discord Nitro, and server boost marks are registered trademarks of Discord, Inc. References to these names and specifications are made strictly for compatibility, educational, and interoperability purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card-panel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[14px]">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#192538] mb-3">3. Accuracy of Validation Rules & Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>
          While we strive to keep our rule registry meticulously synchronized with official Discord documentation and developer guidelines, Discord's internal ingestion algorithms, client revisions, and backend moderation systems may introduce unannounced changes. We provide rule provenance, source URLs, and verification timestamps, but do not guarantee that any asset will bypass Discord moderation or technical limits beyond published rules.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card-panel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[14px]">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#192538] mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          This utility is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind, express or implied. Under no circumstances shall Discord Asset Studio or its contributors be liable for any loss of data, profile modifications, or upload rejections incurred from utilizing this service.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
